wnjelly","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106903#pullrequestreview-2875404750","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106903","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-28T14:47:25Z"},{"id":2880444074,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6rsBaq","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"34152b3f39dbadbad90eb9c5d1f63832abff8086","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Makes sense to me. `inside_tree` used to be called `inside_scene` and was here since Godot was initially made open source.\r\nIt's assigned in 3 places only, `true` on `_propagate_enter_tree` (when `tree` is set) and `false` when `tree` is set to `nullptr` (initial value, and `_propagate_exit_tree`). \r\nI guess the only difference to before might be if `_set_tree` was called with `nullptr`. But it seems sane to me that `inside_tree` should have been set to `false` in this case. It doesn't seem to be right now, so this may actually be an improvement here.\r\n\r\nI think we should merge this, it should be fine and we do still have a few betas before 4.5 release; worst case we'll revert this late and re-examine some other time.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106903#pullrequestreview-2880444074","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106903","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-30T07:43:36Z"},{"id":2889097389,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6sNCCt","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"34152b3f39dbadbad90eb9c5d1f63832abff8086","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106903#pullrequestreview-2889097389","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106903","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-02T16:10:03Z"}]